{"id":"a-inf-1732","category":"info","cover":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20250222/Fp5ObABuSPJnEvUEi2bGCByWI2US.png","region":"global","publishedAt":"2024-06-09","addedAt":"2026-10-13T11:56:49.551Z","tags":[],"title":{"zh":"2024年5月新车灯光欣赏","en":"","ko":""},"summary":{"zh":"BAIC Beijing BJ30上榜理由：前灯采用极细的矩形电镀边框搭配钢琴黑，很有科技感。透镜饰框也比较创新。尾灯猜测是在匀光红材质上开了透明窗口，实现位置制动一体，保持整体简","en":"","ko":""},"body":{"zh":"BAIC Beijing BJ30上榜理由：前灯采用极细的矩形电镀边框搭配钢琴黑，很有科技感。透镜饰框也比较创新。尾灯猜测是在匀光红材质上开了透明窗口，实现位置制动一体，保持整体简洁的风格造型。\n\nRenault Rafale上榜理由：前灯透镜饰框采用小翅膀厚壁造型与银白色装饰件组合，兼具动感与科技。底面的银白色装饰件能很好的反光给厚壁，使得厚壁清晰可见。尾灯块面和线条的组合，很独特，并将刹车灯很好地隐藏在线条之后。\n\n其他车灯赏析BMW Skytop Concept\n\n这些炫彩的水晶放到大灯里会怎样呢~~\n\nCadillac Optiq\n\nCupra Formentor\n\nFerrari 12Cilindri\n\nKia EV3\n\nNissan Epic Concept\n\nNissan Epoch Concept\n\nNissan Era Concept\n\nNissan Evo Concept\n\n内饰中间这条氛围光带，要是真量产会很好看。\n\nRam 1500\n\nRenault Symbioz\n\nRolls-Royce Cullinan Series II哈哈，这莫非是从太上老君的眉毛那里获得的灵感？\n\n——本月分享到此结束，谢谢观赏——","en":"","ko":""},"source":{"name":{"zh":"车灯研究院","en":"Headlight Institute","ko":"차灯연구원"},"type":"web","url":"https://www.dengdengschool.com/article/zaoxing/1732.html","author":""},"content":[{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/bfpNckwxSiaOlTyG148O1TjiaT7GicicPE14nL0HLclW3E7pY8vaV22viaXA91RNS9nv4XjuWv4IcG9r2lHObfy3zmQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&tp=webp&wxfrom=5&wx_lazy=1"},{"t":"text","v":"BAIC Beijing BJ30上榜理由：前灯采用极细的矩形电镀边框搭配钢琴黑，很有科技感。透镜饰框也比较创新。尾灯猜测是在匀光红材质上开了透明窗口，实现位置制动一体，保持整体简洁的风格造型。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240609/FtryX1TfstptCWIp1yysjpsVoCqD.png"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240609/FtSMKjZxE0EQgT6MKLvDuPiA4nVd.png"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240609/FpJ6dHadScs5yyPjexHVNy9Hoc15.png"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240609/Fqx49XyD1_n21ALtCRFFBjdlX_2R.png"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20240609/Ftt93kw04-Ae6DZyt3VeQRgjCznK.png"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/